This product was originally created by and is maintained by the ForgeProof
project contributors. ForgeProof is an open-source code provenance attestation
platform that uses Ed25519 cryptographic signatures and SHA-256 hash chains to
track AI-generated code origin, geographic compliance, and multi-model audit
trails.

